[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0010","text":"树里——。新衣服到了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0020","text":"哦……让我看看让我看看"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0030","text":"呜哇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0040","text":"怎么了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0050","text":"这个，\n是我穿的吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0060","text":"这种飘飘的可爱衣服……\n我、我穿不合适吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0070","text":"不会的。绝对合适"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0080","text":"答得真快……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0090","text":"知道了，穿就是了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11100100_01_0100","text":"但得让我做下心理准备……！"}]
